				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "Slice 1 creates and signals UDP sockets. Slice 2 performs actual datagram I/O and owns peer state, packet validation, fragmentation strategy, pacing, and reliability behaviour."
			},
